<mxCell id="diagram-title" value="DGM-STATE-01 v0.1 Draft | Version lifecycle and independent processing states | 18 October 2026 | Sources: DGM-DESIGN-01 v0.1; PRD-01 v0.9; UC-02 v0.8; SAD-03 v0.16; DATA-04 v0.13; ADR-0007; ADR-0009; ADR-0011; ADR-0013" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry x="30" y="15" width="1740" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="diagram-scope" value="Three separate state domains: a version, a search job, and document availability. No combined product Draft state.&lt;br/&gt;Revision creates a NEW Current identity; the old instance becomes Superseded. Guards, expected revision, idempotency and local audit are prerequisites, not shown as lifecycle states." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry x="30" y="125" width="1740" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
